OL,4,B'No-one's coming to save us' - but how 
OL,5,Bcan Man Utd save themselves?           
OL,6,GManchester United's Premier League     
OL,7,Gtrip to Anfield was described by some  
OL,8,Gas a free hit for new head coach       
OL,9,GMauricio Pochettino.                   
OL,11,FThe theory was expectations for United 
OL,12,Fwere so low as they travelled to       
OL,13,FLiverpool that a positive outcome      
OL,14,Fwould be a huge bonus, and anything    
OL,15,Felse was expected.                     
OL,17,FBut Pochettino did not look like a man 
OL,18,Fwithout pressure after 15 minutes of   
OL,19,Fwhat turned into a 4-0 defeat.         
